+            /* Wrapped for the same reason and on the same terms as
+             * SurfaceCommand: gdi_graphics_pipeline_init() reinstalls its own
+             * EndFrame on every reconnect, so the test is against what is
+             * currently installed rather than against a once-only flag. */
